{"title":"State Farm Car Insurance: The Reported $8.82M Settlement","description":"A reported $8.82 million State Farm car insurance settlement puts a specific claims dispute in focus. An October 7, 2026 report identifies it as a UMPD insurance class action settlement, not a payout promised to every policyholder. We separate that reported total from the eligibility, deadlines, and individual payment details that still require confirmation. What has your experience been with a State Farm car insurance claim in your state?\n\nFor entertainment and informational purposes only. This is not financial, legal, medical, or other professional advice. Consult a qualified professional about your circumstances. We are not responsible for decisions or results based on this video.\n\n#StateFarmcarinsurancesettlement #StateFarmUMPDsettlement #StateFarminsuranceclaims #bestcarinsuranceUnitedStates #carinsurancecustomersatisfaction","tags":["State Farm car insurance settlement","State Farm UMPD settlement","State Farm insurance claims","best car insurance United States","car insurance customer satisfaction","Erie Insurance review","Amica car insurance","Wawanesa California insurance","Shelter Insurance review","Nationwide usage based insurance"],"fallback_query":"State Farm insurance American","frame":"classic","frame_color":"#ffffff","voice_id":"iP95p4xoKVk53GoZ742B","voice_gender":"male","music_mood":"light rhythmic instrumental groove, warm keys, crisp soft percussion, curious and approachable, steady moderate energy, no ominous tension, no sirens or trailer impacts","sfx":true,"voice_provider":"studio","audio_provider":"elevenlabs","reporter_on":false,"hook":"A reported $8.82 million State Farm settlement isn't a promised payment to every policyholder.","reporter_prompt":"A middle-aged American male reporter in a navy blazer stands outside an actual State Farm insurance agency in the United States, with authentic State Farm storefront signage clearly visible behind him. Soft daylight, warm curiosity, respectful conversational delivery, medium framing, subtle camera movement. Do not fabricate signage or imply affiliation. This is the first five seconds of scene zero, not an additional introduction. Apply the following production system throughout the horizontal vi","scenes":[{"text":"Top Class Actions reports an $8.82 million State Farm settlement—not a promised payment to every policyholder.","query":"State Farm storefront American","subject":"state farm storefront","visual":{"type":"broadcast","headline":"STATE FARM STOREFRONT","value":"$8.82 million","color":"dark"},"clip":{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2015/11/27/1406-147169807_medium.mp4","kind":"video","author":"Vimeo-Free-Videos (Pixabay)"},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2015/11/27/1406-147169807_medium.mp4","kind":"video","author":"Vimeo-Free-Videos (Pixabay)"}],"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"The key distinction: a settlement concerns a dispute, not which car insurance is best for you.","query":"insurance shopper American","subject":"insurance shopper","visual":{"type":"title","headline":"INSURANCE SHOPPER","color":"dark"},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2016/01/31/2030-153703078_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"VariousPhotography (Pixabay)"},{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2019/10/31/28544-370332703_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"wowfactorfilms (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2016/01/31/2030-153703078_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"VariousPhotography (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"The report describes a State Farm UMPD class action settlement: uninsured motorist property damage.","query":"State Farm signage American","subject":"state farm signage","visual":{"type":"card","headline":"REPORTED CLAIMS DISPUTE","sub":"UMPD: uninsured motorist property damage","object":"authentic State Farm logo"},"presentationOnly":true},{"text":"That coverage concerns damage to your vehicle involving an uninsured driver, subject to policy terms.","query":"damaged vehicle American","subject":"damaged vehicle","visual":{"type":"title","headline":"DAMAGE TO YOUR VEHICLE","sub":"Coverage depends on policy terms","color":"green"},"clips":[{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599599054812-1fee22d625e1?ixid=M3wxMDkyNjk3fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MjB8fGRyaXZpbmd8ZW58MXx8fHwxNzkxMzQxNTg3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=2400&fit=max&q=85","kind":"photo","author":"Stephan Louis (Unsplash)"},{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2022/11/19/139650-773417986_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"PicturalU (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599599054812-1fee22d625e1?ixid=M3wxMDkyNjk3fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MjB8fGRyaXZpbmd8ZW58MXx8fHwxNzkxMzQxNTg3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=2400&fit=max&q=85","kind":"photo","author":"Stephan Louis (Unsplash)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"The reported total alone doesn't establish your eligibility, filing deadline, or individual payment.","query":"insurance paperwork American","subject":"insurance paperwork","visual":{"type":"ranking","headline":"TOTAL DOESN'T ESTABLISH THESE","color":"dark","items":["Your eligibility","Filing deadline","Individual payment"]},"presentationOnly":true},{"text":"And a settlement headline isn't a national insurance ranking. Customer satisfaction offers a separate comparison.","query":"insurance consultation American","subject":"insurance consultation","visual":{"type":"title","headline":"A DIFFERENT COMPARISON","sub":"Settlement news is not a national ranking","color":"green"},"presentationOnly":true},{"text":"In J.D. Power's 2026 survey, State Farm led the Northwest with 667 satisfaction points out of 1,000.","query":"State Farm agency American","subject":"state farm agency","visual":{"type":"ranking","headline":"NORTHWEST SATISFACTION LEADER","sub":"Satisfaction points • 2026","value":"667/1,000","object":"authentic State Farm logo","source":"J.D. Power • June 9, 2026","items":["NORTHWEST SATISFACTION LEADER — 667/1,000"]},"presentationOnly":true},{"text":"Its Northwest score rose from 648 in 2025 to 667 in 2026, on that same scale.","query":"State Farm office American","subject":"state farm office","visual":{"type":"compare","headline":"NORTHWEST SATISFACTION POINTS","color":"dark","source":"J.D. Power • June 10, 2025; June 9, 2026","left":"2025 • out of 1,000","left_value":"648","right":"2026 • out of 1,000","right_value":"667"},"presentationOnly":true},{"text":"In that survey, Erie Insurance led the Mid-Atlantic with 704 satisfaction points out of 1,000 in 2026.","query":"Erie Insurance agency American","subject":"erie insurance agency","visual":{"type":"broadcast","headline":"ERIE INSURANCE AGENCY","value":"1,000","color":"dark"},"presentationOnly":true},{"text":"Amica led New England with 702 satisfaction points out of 1,000 in 2026.","query":"Amica office American","subject":"amica office","visual":{"type":"ranking","headline":"NEW ENGLAND SATISFACTION LEADER","sub":"Satisfaction points • 2026","value":"702/1,000","object":"authentic Amica logo","source":"J.D. Power • June 9, 2026","items":["NEW ENGLAND SATISFACTION LEADER — 702/1,000"]},"presentationOnly":true},{"text":"Wawanesa led California with 678 satisfaction points out of 1,000 in 2026.","query":"Wawanesa office California","subject":"wawanesa office","visual":{"type":"ranking","headline":"CALIFORNIA SATISFACTION LEADER","sub":"Satisfaction points • 2026","value":"678/1,000","object":"authentic Wawanesa logo","source":"J.D. Power • June 9, 2026","items":["CALIFORNIA SATISFACTION LEADER — 678/1,000"]},"clips":[{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g28d00b0c06ff23d0a117fe7b979262eb353dd29eca39bbfcf47f0251fb451761d2a5d06db8a64a819447c19b033a182b67799197e8ffefb025da0d6d52ce323c_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"Sponchia (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g28d00b0c06ff23d0a117fe7b979262eb353dd29eca39bbfcf47f0251fb451761d2a5d06db8a64a819447c19b033a182b67799197e8ffefb025da0d6d52ce323c_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"Sponchia (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"Shelter Insurance led the Central region with 674 satisfaction points out of 1,000 in 2026.","query":"Shelter Insurance agency American","subject":"shelter insurance agency","visual":{"type":"ranking","headline":"CENTRAL REGION SATISFACTION LEADER","sub":"Satisfaction points • 2026","value":"674/1,000","object":"authentic Shelter Insurance logo","source":"J.D. Power • June 9, 2026","items":["CENTRAL REGION SATISFACTION LEADER — 674/1,000"]},"presentationOnly":true},{"text":"Before we continue, what's your opinion? Does regional customer satisfaction influence your insurance choice?","query":"insurance customer American","subject":"insurance customer","visual":{"type":"poll","headline":"DOES REGIONAL SATISFACTION INFLUENCE YOUR CHOICE?","items":["It influences me","Other factors matter more"],"sub":"What do you think? Comment below."},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2023/10/12/184734-873923034_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"santosjesus90 (Pixabay)"},{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/gc46485c5e020b32c63bd98b5c64123e3cbc2987a40fb66fe82403dfa90bb1e3a54f8c0a2e52e9cb5cdc658b4416aca5453ed4691108314b777a630ca181eaf2c_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"tookapic (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2023/10/12/184734-873923034_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"santosjesus90 (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"Tell us in the comments. Next, consider driving-based insurance programs.","query":"driver entering car American","subject":"driver entering car","visual":{"type":"poll","headline":"DOES REGIONAL SATISFACTION INFLUENCE YOUR CHOICE?","items":["It influences me","Other factors matter more"],"sub":"What do you think? Comment below."},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2022/10/05/133698-757782420_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"blackmarketmusic (Pixabay)"},{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g09f80bd2755193b9627a358ce085d818bf6c36fbf21e961bc2