age limits and deductibles, not just the lowest advertised price.","query":"couple comparing insurance American","subject":"couple comparing insurance","visual":{"type":"ranking","headline":"COMPARE MATCHING PROTECTION","color":"dark","items":["Coverage limits","Deductibles"]},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2016/01/12/1906-151662326_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"VariousPhotography (Pixabay)"},{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577977799980-cd7053d89661?ixid=M3wxMDkyNjk3fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTl8fGRyaXZpbmd8ZW58MXx8fHwxNzkxMzQxNTg3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=2400&fit=max&q=85","kind":"photo","author":"aranprime (Unsplash)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2016/01/12/1906-151662326_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"VariousPhotography (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"The State Farm settlement report concerns a specific dispute; it doesn't decide which policy fits you.","query":"State Farm entrance American","subject":"state farm entrance","visual":{"type":"card","headline":"SPECIFIC DISPUTE, NOT YOUR VERDICT","sub":"A settlement doesn't choose your policy","object":"authentic State Farm logo"},"presentationOnly":true},{"text":"Use regional satisfaction as a starting point, then compare the protection you're buying.","query":"policy review American","subject":"policy review","visual":{"type":"title","headline":"START REGIONAL, COMPARE COVERAGE","sub":"No single winner for every driver","color":"green"},"clips":[{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2022/10/05/133703-757782432_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"blackmarketmusic (Pixabay)"},{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g0d09e31d5e917e0786457e7aebefa18cb2ef9435a6ac7bca8cbdf81ed643d9b21b1fd9cf0e03df01181df33107012d5ccb35b7bb6436a074dcec9138c9a8efbf_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"18193486 (Pixabay)"}],"clip":{"url":"https://cdn.pixabay.com/video/2022/10/05/133703-757782432_large.mp4","kind":"video","author":"blackmarketmusic (Pixabay)"},"presentationOnly":false},{"text":